    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about being tired though. it's like the scenery itself has died. there's no \"new footing\" to find when the ground beneath me is just gone. it feels more like an ending than a pause. like the story was supposed to end here, at this cliff, because there's nothing else worth seeing.",
